00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:55.520
was not enough amid the uncertainty that the global economy is experiencing now,

00:12:55.520 --> 00:13:02.040
therefore the market was not affected as expected. It could have been affected if the raise was half percent for example.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:06.880
