00:15:11.800 --> 00:15:19.320
Economists and experts see health from a farther and deeper perspective as one of the most important financial assets

00:15:19.320 --> 00:15:25.400
To be accurate, it is the most vital and valuable asset our Lord Almighty gave us for free, so one must preserve it

00:15:25.400 --> 00:15:31.400
Preventing diseases saves you huge amounts of money, other than the wasted times that cost other huge sums,

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:36.120
there are dozens of economic studies and researches that measure the economic costs of disease,

00:15:36.120 --> 00:15:42.360
and among the costs of disease are what economists call the value of lost output,

00:15:42.360 --> 00:15:44.772
and this is the result of stopping or declining productivity,

00:15:44.772 --> 00:15:50.000
and it affects not only you and your financial status, but the economy of the entire country

00:15:50.000 --> 00:15:55.840
Your body must be preserved as much as possible in order to stay well and not be financially drained in the long term,

00:15:55.840 --> 00:16:02.160
and therefore maintain your health, sleep enough, eat healthy food as much as possible, reduce fast food, and consume as much as possible according to what is available

00:16:02.160 --> 00:16:04.800
Certainly, neither you nor me have the same options considering our health status that Cristiano Ronaldo of course has

00:16:04.800 --> 00:16:08.000
Cut down on junk food, sugars and unhealthy food

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:14.280
So, this is possible for anyone to apply regardless of their financial level and we all know this. Do this an everyday routine, then if you get sick it would be the lord's will,

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:15.640
and this is another separate issue, may God heal everyone,

00:16:15.640 --> 00:16:21.560
but other than that, there are many steps that you can take in advance to preserve your health with a little hard work.

